<title>ITALY: Aeroporti di Roma starts at 14,200 lire.</title>
<headline>Aeroporti di Roma starts at 14,200 lire.</headline>
<dateline>MILAN 1997-07-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in newly-listed Aeroporti di Roma started trading on the Milan bourse at 14,200 lire, up 29 percent from the offer price of 11,000 lire, dealers said.</p>
<p>The shares in the airport management company were temporarily suspended earlier after they were quoted 31 percent higher than their offer price in pre-trading, a spokeswoman for Italy's stock exchange council had said earlier.</p>
<p>-- Milan newsroom +392 66129502</p>
